name ud-documentation
# A page of the Universal Dependencies documentation. Its front matter names what the page is about (title: 'NOUN')
# and gives a short definition of it (shortdef: 'noun'), said of it under the field's own name. A heading that names a
# value (### <a name="Number">`Number`</a>: number) says the value and what it is called.
match *.md

tier line by \n

about ^title: '(.*)'$
line ^(shortdef): '(.*)'$
line ^### <a name="[^"]*">`([^`]+)`</a>: (.*)$ :: pair
